              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "France C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Slightly tangy, slightly sweet, perfectly balanced and oh so refreshing. This would make a great drink on a hot day, but really, I'd have one any time of year! It definitely goes down easy! This one is getting added to my regular rotation. TIP: to make a shortcut version of simple syrup, just add equal parts sugar and room temperature water to a jar and shake vigorously until sugar is dissolved.",
